{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52913","headline":"独坐敬亭山（其二） · 李白","name":"独坐敬亭山（其二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合沓牵数峰，奔地镇平楚。\n中间最高顶，髣髴接天语。\n（见《宛陵郡志备要》。\n又见嘉庆廿年刊洪亮吉纂《宁国府志》卷二四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"萧涤非"}